on_external":20,"button_secondary":132,"secondary_button_external":20},"Save big on your deliveries",[103,111],{"type":33,"text":104,"spans":105,"direction":36},"Did we mention we’re the cheapest in the UK market when you purchase directly? Whether you’ve got a gift to send or a business to run, start saving on shipping with our unbeatable prices.",[106,108],{"start":107,"end":75,"type":67},25,{"start":109,"end":110,"type":67},169,186,{"type":33,"text":112,"spans":113,"direction":36},"With 95% of the UK urban population living within just a mile of our ParcelShop and Locker locations, your recipients can collect their parcels at a time and place that works best for them - whether it’s their local OneStop, Post Office, or another trusted retailer. By slashing ParcelShop to ParcelShop prices, you can keep costs low while enjoying a convenient and reliable service.",[114,117,120],{"start":115,"end":116,"type":67},5,62,{"start":118,"end":119,"type":67},216,223,{"start":121,"end":122,"type":67},225,236,{"dimensions":124,"alt":125,"copyright":42,"url":126,"id":127,"edit":128},{"width":82,"height":83},"Woman handing parcel to cashier at Post Office","parcelshop-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fad941cc1-66cb-47db-912a-0d4b785cd153_DSCF4172.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C287%2C6924%2C4618&w=1000&h=667","ZTvF5BUAACkAYc82",{"x":46,"y":129,"zoom":47,"background":88},287,true,{"link_type":95},{"link_type":95},"landing_feature_banner$b3261620-c862-4f38-9b02-6f74088f26ed",{"variation":135,"version":25,"items":136,"primary":172,"id":180,"slice_type":181,"slice_label":42},"default-slice",[137,142,146,150,154,158,162,167],{"column_1_cell":138,"column_2_cell":139,"column_3_cell":140,"column_4_cell":141},"Postable","£2.70","£2.62","£0.08",{"column_1_cell":143,"column_2_cell":144,"column_3_cell":140,"column_4_cell":145},"0-1kg Small","£3.04","£0.47",{"column_1_cell":147,"column_2_cell":148,"column_3_cell":140,"column_4_cell":149},"0-1kg Standard","£3.29","£0.67",{"column_1_cell":151,"column_2_cell":152,"column_3_cell":140,"column_4_cell":153},"1-2kg Small","£3.52","£0.90",{"column_1_cell":155,"column_2_cell":156,"column_3_cell":140,"column_4_cell":157},"1-2kg Standard","£4.79","£2.17",{"column_1_cell":159,"column_2_cell":160,"column_3_cell":140,"column_4_cell":161},"2-5kg","£6.59","£3.97",{"column_1_cell":163,"column_2_cell":164,"column_3_cell":165,"column_4_cell":166},"5-10kg","£6.68","£5.87","£0.81",{"column_1_cell":168,"column_2_cell":169,"column_3_cell":170,"column_4_cell":171},"10-15kg","£10.28","£9.01","£1.27",{"SectionTitle":173,"SectionSubtitle":174,"TableFooter":42,"InformationTableButtonUrl":175,"InformationTableButtonText":42,"table_header_row_blue":20,"table_rightmost_column_blue":20,"column_name_1":176,"column_name_2":177,"column_name_3":178,"column_name_4":179},"Standard delivery services","See how our prices compare for Standard delivery to a home or work address versus a ParcelShop.",{"link_type":95},"Weight","Home or work delivery","ParcelShop delivery","Savings","information_table_v2$f1454f5e-8487-45f9-b173-ea24b078e6c5","information_table_v2",{"variation":135,"version":25,"items":183,"primary":206,"id":210,"slice_type":181,"slice_label":42},[184,188,192,196,199,202],{"column_1_cell":138,"column_2_cell":185,"column_3_cell":186,"column_4_cell":187},"£3.49","£3.20","£0.29",{"column_1_cell":189,"column_2_cell":190,"column_3_cell":186,"column_4_cell":191},"0-1kg","£4.12","£0.92",{"column_1_cell":193,"column_2_cell":194,"column_3_cell":186,"column_4_cell":195},"1-2kg","£5.48","£2.28",{"column_1_cell":159,"column_2_cell":197,"column_3_cell":186,"column_4_cell":198},"£7.55","£4.35",{"column_1_cell":163,"column_2_cell":200,"column_3_cell":201,"column_4_cell":153},"£7.72","£6.82",{"column_1_cell":168,"column_2_cell":203,"column_3_cell":204,"column_4_cell":205},"£12.35","£10.61","£1.74",{"SectionTitle":207,"SectionSubtitle":208,"TableFooter":42,"InformationTableButtonUrl":209,"InformationTableButtonText":42,"table_header_row_blue":20,"table_rightmost_column_blue":20,"column_name_1":176,"column_name_2":177,"column_name_3":178,"column_name_4":179},"Next Day delivery services","See how our prices compare for Next Day delivery to a home or work address versus a ParcelShop.",{"link_type":95},"information_table_v2$a0388414-07a9-40d6-b1ee-85380fd6ea01",{"variation":135,"version":25,"items":212,"primary":213,"id":243,"slice_type":244,"slice_label":42},[],{"CardImage":214,"CardAvatar":221,"CardTitle":222,"CardText":223,"ButtonText":239,"ButtonUrl":240,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":215,"alt":216,"copyright":42,"url":217,"id":218,"edit":219},{"width":82,"height":83},"ParcelShop store assistant is smiling and handing a blue receipt to the customer to confirm that their parcels have been accepted.","parcelshop-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJCZbqstJ9-Tfj_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2610.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=47%2C0%2C5906%2C3939&w=1000&h=667","Z6TJCZbqstJ9-Tfj",{"x":220,"y":46,"zoom":47,"background":88},47,"none","How does it work?",[224,230,233],{"type":33,"text":225,"spans":226,"direction":36},"Before you follow the steps below to book a delivery to a ParcelShop, make sure your recipient is happy with this service, and you’ll also need your recipient’s email address. We’ll use this to notify them when their parcel has arrived and is ready to collect. ",[227],{"start":228,"end":229,"type":67},149,174,{"type":33,"text":231,"spans":232,"direction":36},"If the parcel hasn’t been collected within 10 days, it will be returned. Your recipient will need to bring a form of identification to collect their parcel. A debit or credit card, passport, UK driving license or utility bill will be accepted.",[],{"type":33,"text":234,"spans":235,"direction":36},"If you’re unsure which ParcelShop to deliver to, use our ParcelShop finder to enter your recipient’s address and locate the nearest ParcelShop.",[236],{"start":237,"end":238,"type":67},57,74,"Find my nearest ParcelShop",{"link_type":91,"key":241,"url":242},"b51919e6-cf44-4225-b09a-08adee944b85","parcelshop-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ffind-a-parcelshop","card$054514a3-f72e-4421-94f1-53ecf10a5635","card",{"variation":246,"version":25,"items":247,"primary":274,"id":275,"slice_type":276,"slice_label":42},"listNoIcon",[248,254,268],{"title":249,"content":250,"isNumbered":130},"Book online",[251],{"type":33,"text":252,"spans":253,"direction":36},"Start booking your parcel delivery on Evri.com. You’ll just need to keep an eye out when choosing your parcel delivery location, so you can select ‘deliver to a ParcelShop’.",[],{"title":255,"content":256,"isNumbered":130},"Drop off your parcel",[257],{"type":33,"text":258,"spans":259,"direction":36},"Take the parcel to your nearest ParcelShop. Don’t have a printer? No problem! You can use our Print in ParcelShop service to print your label for free.",[260,267],{"start":261,"end":262,"type":263,"data":264},94,113,"hyperlink",{"link_type":91,"url":265,"target":266},"parcelshop-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops\u002Fprint-in-parcelshop","_self",{"start":261,"end":262,"type":67},{"title":269,"content":270,"isNumbered":130},"Recipient can collect the parcel",[271],{"type":33,"text":272,"spans":273,"direction":36},"We’ll let your recipient know when their parcel is ready for collection. With convenient locations, longer opening hours and free nearby parking, collecting a parcel has never been easier! Remember to check the recipient’s contact details are correct, so they can receive important delivery updates on their items.",[],{"theme":29,"title":42,"description":42,"showPaddingTop":20},"list_block$3058469a-4abf-48be-b56b-1e8133ebbd70","list_block",{"variation":135,"version":25,"items":278,"primary":279,"id":303,"slice_type":304,"slice_label":42},[],{"Image":280},{"dimensions":281,"alt":284,"copyright":42,"url":285,"id":286,"edit":287,"mobile":289,"tablet":296},{"width":282,"height":283},1200,280,"A father is measuring the circumference of a parcel box at his desk using measuring tape. His children are resting on the sofa behind him.","parcelshop-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zc-5bqstJ9-inW_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7708.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C3024%2C8192%2C1911&w=1200&h=280","Z6zc-5bqstJ9-inW",{"x":46,"y":288,"zoom":47,"background":88},3024,{"dimensions":290,"alt":284,"copyright":42,"url":293,"id":286,"edit":294},{"width":291,"height":292},343,160,"parcelshop-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zc-5bqstJ9-inW_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7708.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C1223%2C8192%2C3821&w=343&h=160",{"x":46,"y":295,"zoom":47,"background":88},1223,{"dimensions":297,"alt":284,"copyright":42,"url":300,"id":286,"edit":301},{"width":298,"height":299},704,240,"parcelshop-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zc-5bqstJ9-inW_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7708.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C2671%2C8192%2C2793&w=704&h=240",{"x":46,"y":302,"zoom":47,"background":88},2671,"photo_block$2ec4ad8c-f3ae-4be4-8e79-de6760de7a97","photo_block",{"variation":306,"version":25,"items":307,"primary":351,"id":353,"slice_type":276,"slice_label":42},"listComponent",[308,327,339],{"title":309,"content":310,"icon":320},"Save more money",[311],{"type":33,"text":312,"spans":313,"direction":36},"With prices starting at £2.62 for up to 5kg parcels, this is the UK’s cheapest shop-to-shop delivery service available.",[314,317],{"start":315,"end":316,"type":67},24,29,{"start":318,"end":319,"type":67},70,79,{"dimensions":321,"alt":323,"copyright":42,"url":324,"id":325,"edit":326},{"width":322,"height":322},40,"Pricing icon","parcelshop-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F0d6596ea-88df-43fd-b67a-22e944657aa2_pricing.svg","Yh96FhIAACkA-Zrx",{"x":46,"y":46,"zoom":47,"background":88},{"title":328,"content":329,"icon":333},"Easy drop-off options",[330],{"type":33,"text":331,"spans":332,"direction":36},"9,000+ conveniently located ParcelShops, open up to 7 days a week, with longer opening hours and free nearby parking - we’ve made sending stress-free for you.",[],{"dimensions":334,"alt":335,"copyright":42,"url":336,"id":337,"edit":338},{"width":322,"height":322},"Parcelshop icon","parcelshop-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F6fb8763e-f02b-40b7-8e67-a916528bac93_parcelshop.svg","Yh96GBIAAC0A-Zsl",{"x":46,"y":46,"zoom":47,"background":88},{"title":340,"content":341,"icon":345},"Boost your business",[342],{"type":33,"text":343,"spans":344,"direction":36},"Cut costs while offering flexible delivery options to your customers.",[],{"dimensions":346,"alt":347,"copyright":42,"url":348,"id":349,"edit":350},{"width":322,"height":322},"Success icon","parcelshop-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8d947c5f-d007-4da4-b0c6-86691eda4240_success.svg","Yh96GBIAACwA-Zsm",{"x":46,"y":46,"zoom":47,"background":88},{"theme":29,"title":352,"description":42},"Benefits for you","list_block$260dc704-cc21-46df-a03b-43b3db9bb331",{"variation":306,"version":25,"items":355,"primary":392,"id":394,"slice_type":276,"slice_label":42},[356,368,380],{"title":357,"content":358,"icon":362},"Flexible collection",[359],{"type":33,"text":360,"spans":361,"direction":36},"When you choose a delivery to a ParcelShop and select a nearby store for your recipient, they can collect at a time that suits them.",[],{"dimensions":363,"alt":364,"copyright":42,"url":365,"id":366,"edit":367},{"width":322,"height":322},"Location icon","parcelshop-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8ee71b91-4c7d-4419-a907-ef6a4f89d913_location+pin.svg","Yh96FxIAACgA-ZsP",{"x":46,"y":46,"zoom":47,"background":88},{"title":369,"content":370,"icon":374},"Regular tracking updates",[371],{"type":33,"text":372,"spans":373,"direction":36},"Notifications let your recipients know when their parcel is ready to collect.",[],{"dimensions":375,"alt":376,"copyright":42,"url":377,"id":378,"edit":379},{"width":322,"height":322},"Phone icon","parcelshop-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fd7cc2443-0047-4998-a550-fabf5e0f598a_phone.svg","Yh96FxIAACwA-Zse",{"x":46,"y":46,"zoom":47,"background":88},{"title":381,"content":382,"icon":386},"Hassle-free",[383],{"type":33,"text":384,"spans":385,"direction":36},"No more waiting around or changing plans to receive deliveries at home - your recipients can collect their parcels as soon as it’s convenient for them.",[],{"dimensions":387,"alt":388,"copyright":42,"url":389,"id":390,"edit":391},{"width":322,"height":322},"Icon of a clock","parcelshop-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F40f1b5ea-7a5c-44d7-8e16-86d427c88a1d_its_too_late1.svg","Yh96GBIAACoA-Zsp",{"x":46,"y":46,"zoom":47,"background":88},{"theme":29,"title":393,"description":42},"Benefits for your recipients","list_block$edc17bbf-1371-4fd8-8d47-057cd101269a",{"variation":396,"version":25,"items":397,"primary":398,"id":409,"slice_type":244,"slice_label":42},"cardNoImageWithCta",[],{"CardAvatar":399,"CardTitle":400,"CardText":401,"ButtonText":42,"ButtonUrl":408,"IsEco":20},"eco_leaf","Eco-friendly and sustainable",[402],{"type":33,"text":403,"spans":404,"direction":36},"By dropping off at a ParcelShop, you’re helping reduce a parcel’s carbon footprint (CO2e) by 27% on average. When you choose deliveries to ParcelShops, it means fewer miles are travelled and fewer delivery attempts, making this a more sustainable delivery method. ",[405],{"start":406,"end":407,"type":67},48,96,{"link_type":95},"card$d4964011-b505-4542-89e1-0970043757f0",{"variation":396,"version":25,"items":411,"primary":412,"id":460,"slice_type":244,"slice_label":42},[],{"CardAvatar":221,"CardTitle":413,"CardText":414,"ButtonText":42,"ButtonUrl":459,"IsEco":20},"Terms and Conditions",[415,421,435,438,441,444,447,450],{"type":416,"text":417,"spans":418,"direction":36},"list-item","Only parcels using the ParcelShop to ParcelShop delivery service will be included in the promotional prices",[419],{"start":420,"end":406,"type":67},23,{"type":416,"text":422,"spans":423,"direction":36},"ParcelShop to ParcelShop services are not currently available using quick send and bulk send tools.  ",[424,429,430,434],{"start":425,"end":426,"type":263,"data":427},68,78,{"link_type":91,"url":428,"target":266},"parcelshop-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fcustomer\u002Fquick-send",{"start":425,"end":426,"type":67},{"start":40,"end":431,"type":263,"data":432},92,{"link_type":91,"url":433,"target":266},"parcelshop-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fcustomer\u002Fbulk-upload",{"start":40,"end":431,"type":67},{"type":416,"text":436,"spans":437,"direction":36},"The discounted prices are available for parcels weighing between 0 and 5kg for Standard and Next Day deliveries.",[],{"type":416,"text":439,"spans":440,"direction":36},"All prices shown include VAT.",[],{"type":416,"text":442,"spans":443,"direction":36},"Our unbeatable prices are compared against our UK competitors when you purchase directly, not including a third party or reseller.",[],{"type":416,"text":445,"spans":446,"direction":36},"The maximum parcel length accepted for ParcelShop deliveries is 120cm.",[],{"type":416,"text":448,"spans":449,"direction":36},"If the parcel hasn’t been collected by your recipient within 10 days, it will be returned.  Your recipient will need to bring a form of identification to collect their parcel. A debit or credit card, passport, UK driving licence or utility bill will be accepted.",[],{"type":416,"text":451,"spans":452,"direction":36},"Read full Terms and Conditions",[453,458],{"start":46,"end":454,"type":263,"data":455},30,{"link_type":91,"url":456,"target":457},"parcelshop-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fterms-and-conditions","_blank",{"start":46,"end":454,"type":67},{"link_type":95},"card$6f758208-2401-4236-a315-0da00e03ccd9",{"variation":135,"version":25,"items":462,"primary":527,"id":529,"slice_type":530,"slice_label":42},[463,472,478,484,495,506,519],{"questionTitle":464,"questionBody":465},"How long is this offer available?",[466],{"type":33,"text":467,"spans":468,"direction":36},"This is a limited-time offer, so act fast to take advantage of these unbeatable rates on Evri.com!",[469],{"start":470,"end":471,"type":67},10,28,{"questionTitle":473,"questionBody":474},"What is the maximum parcel weight for this service?",[475],{"type":33,"text":476,"spans":477,"direction":36},"You can send parcels weighing up to 15kg using our ParcelShop to ParcelShop service. Please note, the promotional pricing is only available on 0-5kg parcels.",[],{"questionTitle":479,"questionBody":480},"Why do I need my recipient’s email address?",[481],{"type":33,"text":482,"spans":483,"direction":36},"We use the recipient’s email address to send them important service updates, including when their parcel has arrived and is ready to collect.",[],{"questionTitle":485,"questionBody":486},"Can I use this service if I don’t have a printer?",[487],{"type":33,"text":488,"spans":489,"direction":36},"Yes! Use our Print in ParcelShop devices to print your label for free before you drop off in-store.",[490,494],{"start":491,"end":492,"type":263,"data":493},13,32,{"link_type":91,"url":265,"target":266},{"start":491,"end":492,"type":67},{"questionTitle":496,"questionBody":497},"How can I find the nearest ParcelShop for my recipient?",[498],{"type":33,"text":499,"spans":500,"direction":36},"Use the ParcelShop Finder tool on our website. Simply enter the recipient’s postcode, and we’ll show you the closest ParcelShops to choose from for them to collect their parcel.",[501,505],{"start":502,"end":107,"type":263,"data":503},8,{"link_type":91,"url":504,"target":266},"parcelshop-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ffind-a-parcelshop\u002F",{"start":502,"end":107,"type":67},{"questionTitle":507,"questionBody":508},"Are there any restrictions on what I can send?",[509],{"type":33,"text":510,"spans":511,"direction":36},"Please check our guide on what you can and can’t send with our couriers.",[512,517],{"start":513,"end":514,"type":263,"data":515},26,53,{"link_type":91,"url":516,"target":266},"parcelshop-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend\u002Fwhat-i-can-and-cannot-send",{"start":513,"end":518,"type":67},54,{"questionTitle":520,"questionBody":521},"Can I send international parcels using this service?",[522],{"type":33,"text":523,"spans":524,"direction":36},"This promotion is currently for UK-only ParcelShop to ParcelShop deliveries. International options are available in Sweden, Finland and Denmark.",[525],{"start":492,"end":526,"type":67},39,{"title":528},"FAQs","frequently_asked_questions$414e80f6-84da-414f-b975-8ec2ed65607c","frequently_asked_questions",[23,53,98,134,182,211,245,277,305,354,395,410,461],["Reactive",533],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":534,"$sclients":600,"$sglobal-basket-count":42},{"abtasty":535,"accessibe":538,"appPromoBanner":541,"autoDivertUpdates":544,"awin":547,"bulkInternational":550,"bulkSendEnabled":553,"businessAccountForm75Enabled":556,"enableBasketCount":559,"enableBulkPhaseTwo":562,"euCustomsDuty":565,"groovyAdvert":568,"newInternationalSendFlow":571,"newinternationalpages":578,"oohPreferenceFlag":582,"opentel":585,"premium":588,"savedCards":591,"smallParcelSize":594,"yourPricesDrawer":597},{"_createdAt":536,"_updatedAt":537,"enabled":130},"2025-11-05T15:39:37.217Z","2025-11-05T15:39:37.452Z",{"_createdAt":539,"_updatedAt":540,"enabled":130},"2025-07-15T08:41:16.873Z","2025-10-28T11:52:03.675Z",{"_createdAt":542,"_updatedAt":543,"enabled":20},"2026-03-06T12:16:35.816Z","2026-03-06T12:16:36.662Z",{"_createdAt":545,"_updatedAt":546,"enabled":20},"2026-04-30T13:26:45.107Z","2026-04-30T13:26:45.355Z",{"_createdAt":548,"_updatedAt":549,"enabled":20},"2025-08-19T09:46:14.552Z","2025-09-02T10:23:26.022Z",{"_createdAt":551,"_updatedAt":552